    "body": "Here are screenshots of the experiment on my Android phone, this also appears to act the same way in Chrome Linux and ChromeOS. \r\n\r\nBefore fullscreen:\r\n![screen-fullscreenblend-1](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1392351/76992051-da841c00-6907-11ea-9a9f-fa4d31d952bf.png)\r\n\r\nAfter entering fullscreen, with transparent backdrop:\r\n![screen-fullscreenblend-2](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1392351/76992050-da841c00-6907-11ea-9679-2481a18d603b.png)\r\n\r\nFullscreen with black backdrop (disabling the custom backdrop color):\r\n![screen-fullscreenblend-3](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1392351/76992048-d9eb8580-6907-11ea-97b3-9c022fb12a23.png)\r\n",
