    "updated_at": "2020-03-18T18:08:38Z",
    "body": "To clarify, the behavior appears to be as expected when using the default black backdrop. The unexpected results appear for a transparent backdrop, and I'm unsure if this is expected to work, but the browser doesn't currently stop me from doing this. The experiment just used normal CSS rules, I didn't modify the browser or UA stylesheets.",
